{"sectionId":"metabolism/tca","items":[{"id":"metabolism--tca-k001","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"피루브산 탈수소효소 복합체는 미토콘드리아 기질에서 pyruvate+CoA+NAD⁺→acetyl-CoA+CO₂+NADH를 촉매한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k002","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"TPP(B₁), 리포아마이드, CoA(B₅), FAD(B₂), NAD⁺(B₃)가 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k003","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"생성물 NADH와 acetyl-CoA는 활성을 억제하며 PDH 인산화는 억제적으로 작용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k004","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"TCA 회로의 순서는 oxaloacetate+acetyl-CoA→citrate→isocitrate→α-ketoglutarate→succinyl-CoA→succinate→fumarate→malate→oxaloacetate이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k005","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Isocitrate dehydrogenase와 α-ketoglutarate dehydrogenase에서 NADH와 CO₂가 생성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k006","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Succinyl-CoA synthetase에서 GTP 또는 ATP, succinate dehydrogenase에서 FADH₂에 해당하는 환원당량, malate dehydrogenase에서 NADH가 생성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k007","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"회로는 아미노산과 헴 합성의 중간체 공급원도 된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k008","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Pyruvate carboxylase는 biotin과 ATP를 사용해 oxaloacetate를 보충한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k009","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"acetyl-CoA당 3 NADH, 1 FAD 환원당량, 1 GTP/ATP, 2 CO₂.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k010","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"포도당당 TCA 2회.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k011","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"TCA에서 O₂를 직접 소비하지 않지만 산화환원 보조인자 재생을 위해 일반적으로 호흡사슬에 의존한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--tca-k012","sectionId":"metabolism/tca","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"2+2+6=10개다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}